@startuml
' ===== loan-system R1 概念模型（翻译自 raw/requirements-register.md）=====
' 翻译位: ZCode/GLM 2026-08-26; 覆盖: FIELD-001~003, RULE-001~004, FLOW-001~002, BR-002

class Borrower {
  +id : String
  +name : String
  +id_number : String
  +phone : String
  +income : Decimal
  +employer : String
  +position : String
}

class LoanOrder {
  +id : String
  +amount : Decimal
  +term_months : Integer
  +purpose : LoanPurpose
  +interest_rate : Decimal
  +status : OrderStatus
}

class CreditResult {
  +score : Integer
  +approved_amount : Decimal
  +approved_rate : Decimal
  +decision_reason : String
}

enum OrderStatus {
  draft
  pending
  approved
  rejected
  active
  closed
}
enum LoanPurpose {
  renovation
  education
  travel
  medical
}
enum CreditDecision {
  approved
  rejected
}

' @disjoint: OrderStatus_draft, OrderStatus_pending, OrderStatus_approved, OrderStatus_rejected, OrderStatus_active, OrderStatus_closed
' @disjoint: LoanPurpose_renovation, LoanPurpose_education, LoanPurpose_travel, LoanPurpose_medical
' 注解说明(RULE-003): 用途枚举4类互斥 —— 本注解行即 RULE-003 在模型层的承接（对照静态评估发现的丢失缺陷）
' 注解说明(FLOW-001): OrderStatus 六态互斥; rejected 为终态的"不可回流"是转换规则非状态互斥, 由流程线承载

Borrower "1" --> "0..*" LoanOrder : places
LoanOrder "1" --> "0..1" CreditResult : hasDecision

' ===== 人工裁决记录（2026-08-27, 裁决事实源=review/41-人工决策记录-S4.md）=====
' @decision: FLOW-002 = 原始需求歧义确认; MVP 按最简原则忽略人工处理环节(自动审批即生效) —— 采纳 US/design 侧语义
' @decision: RULE-004 = 费率定位为外部系统衔接点(MVP 退化固定值); Z2 默认值由实现侧配置承载
' @decision: FIELD-002 = borrower 关联为外部系统对接点, MVP 简化设计
@enduml
